    "title": "System overview: data pipeline, Hadoop/Spark cluster and deployments",
    "system": {
      "name": "CST435 taxi analytics",
      "one_liner": "one Python MapReduce job code run by five engines on a containerised Hadoop/Spark cluster, locally and on Azure"
